## ❓ Frequently Asked Questions

### 📐 What is PixelSnap for Mac?

PixelSnap is a Mac utility for measuring distances, dimensions, spacing, alignment, and visible objects directly on your screen.

### 🎯 Can PixelSnap measure any application?

Yes. PixelSnap is designed to work across the screen and can measure content displayed in different Mac applications.

### 🧲 How does object snapping work?

You drag around a visible object and PixelSnap can automatically adjust the selection to the object's boundaries.

### 📏 Can I measure the distance between two elements?

Yes. PixelSnap provides a distance-measuring workflow for checking spacing between visible screen elements.

### 📋 Can I copy measurements?

Yes. Measured dimensions can be copied to the clipboard for use in other applications.

### 🧭 Does PixelSnap have alignment guides?

Yes. You can add horizontal and vertical guides and use them to inspect alignment and spacing.

### 🖱️ What is Crosshair Mode?

Crosshair Mode provides visual horizontal and vertical references that help you inspect the alignment of elements across your screen.

### 🌗 What is Tolerance Mode?

Tolerance Mode lets you adjust how PixelSnap detects visual boundaries, which can be useful for shadows and low-contrast objects.

### 📸 Can PixelSnap take screenshots?

Yes. PixelSnap can capture selected measurement areas as images and also integrates with CleanShot.

### 🎨 Does PixelSnap work with Figma and Sketch?

Yes. The official PixelSnap site lists integrations and workflows involving Sketch, Figma, Affinity applications, and CleanShot.

### 🖥️ Does PixelSnap support Retina displays?

Yes. PixelSnap is designed for Retina displays and high-resolution Mac screens.

### 🖥️ Can I use PixelSnap with multiple monitors?

Yes. The application supports workflows involving multiple displays.

### ⌨️ Can I customize keyboard shortcuts?

Yes. PixelSnap lets users customize its global activation hotkey and other shortcuts.

### 💳 Does PixelSnap use a subscription?

PixelSnap is sold as a one-time purchase rather than requiring a recurring subscription.

### 🛡️ Is there a money-back guarantee?

Yes. The official PixelSnap website currently advertises a **30-day money-back guarantee**.

